{
  "type": "AdaptiveCard",
  "$schema": "http://adaptivecards.io/schemas/adaptive-card.json",
  "version": "1.5",
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "How to use AISO",
      "weight": "Bolder",
      "size": "Large",
      "wrap": true
    },
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "New here? Follow the flow for your role, then use a shortcut or type a short English command.",
      "wrap": true,
      "isSubtle": true,
      "spacing": "Small"
    },
    {
      "type": "Container",
      "style": "emphasis",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "$when": "${role == 'Employee'}",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "text": "Employee flow (release request)",
          "weight": "Bolder",
          "wrap": true
        },
        {
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "text": "1. Show your orders (list or open orders)\n2. Open **View details** on the order you own\n3. Tap **Request release** → confirm\n4. Wait for a Manager — status stays Open with **Approval: Waiting**\n5. Optional: **Reject** or **Forward** only on orders you own",
          "wrap": true,
          "spacing": "Small"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "Container",
      "style": "emphasis",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "$when": "${role == 'Manager'}",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "text": "Manager flow (approve release)",
          "weight": "Bolder",
          "wrap": true
        },
        {
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "text": "1. Open **Pending approvals**\n2. Review the order → **View details** if needed\n3. **Approve** (releases in SAP) or **Reject approval** (keeps order, clears pending)\n4. You can also browse orders / KPIs anytime",
          "wrap": true,
          "spacing": "Small"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "Container",
      "style": "emphasis",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "$when": "${role == 'Admin'}",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "text": "Admin flow",
          "weight": "Bolder",
          "wrap": true
        },
        {
          "type": "TextBlock",
          "text": "1. Use pending approvals like a Manager when needed\n2. **View audit log** for who did what\n3. Force release / force cancel only for emergencies",
          "wrap": true,
          "spacing": "Small"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "Shortcuts",
      "weight": "Bolder",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "$when": "${role == 'Employee'}"
    },
    {
      "type": "ActionSet",
      "$when": "${role == 'Employee'}",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "Action.Submit",
          "title": "Recent orders",
          "data": {
            "msteams": {
              "type": "messageBack",
              "displayText": "Recent orders",
              "text": "recent orders"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Action.Submit",
          "title": "Revenue KPI",
          "data": {
            "msteams": {
              "type": "messageBack",
              "displayText": "Revenue KPI",
              "text": "show revenue kpi"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Action.Submit",
          "title": "Request release",
          "data": {
            "msteams": {
              "type": "messageBack",
              "displayText": "Request release",
              "text": "request release"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "spacing": "Small"
    },
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "Shortcuts",
      "weight": "Bolder",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "$when": "${role == 'Manager'}"
    },
    {
      "type": "ActionSet",
      "$when": "${role == 'Manager'}",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "Action.Submit",
          "title": "Pending approvals",
          "data": {
            "msteams": {
              "type": "messageBack",
              "displayText": "Pending approvals",
              "text": "show pending approvals"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Action.Submit",
          "title": "Approve order",
          "data": {
            "msteams": {
              "type": "messageBack",
              "displayText": "Approve order",
              "text": "approve order"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Action.Submit",
          "title": "Reject approval",
          "data": {
            "msteams": {
              "type": "messageBack",
              "displayText": "Reject approval",
              "text": "reject approval"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "spacing": "Small"
    },
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "Shortcuts",
      "weight": "Bolder",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "$when": "${role == 'Admin'}"
    },
    {
      "type": "ActionSet",
      "$when": "${role == 'Admin'}",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "Action.Submit",
          "title": "View audit log",
          "data": {
            "msteams": {
              "type": "messageBack",
              "displayText": "View audit log",
              "text": "view audit log"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Action.Submit",
          "title": "Pending approvals",
          "data": {
            "msteams": {
              "type": "messageBack",
              "displayText": "Pending approvals",
              "text": "show pending approvals"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Action.Submit",
          "title": "Revenue KPI",
          "data": {
            "msteams": {
              "type": "messageBack",
              "displayText": "Revenue KPI",
              "text": "show revenue kpi"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "spacing": "Small"
    },
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "Try saying (English)",
      "weight": "Bolder",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "size": "Small",
      "$when": "${role == 'Employee'}"
    },
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "• recent orders · show order 13122\n• request release 13122 · reject order 13122\n• forward order 13122 to DEV-xxx\n• show revenue kpi · logout",
      "wrap": true,
      "spacing": "Small",
      "size": "Small",
      "$when": "${role == 'Employee'}"
    },
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "Try saying (English)",
      "weight": "Bolder",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "size": "Small",
      "$when": "${role == 'Manager'}"
    },
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "• show pending approvals\n• approve order 13122 · reject approval 13122\n• show order 13122 · show revenue kpi · logout",
      "wrap": true,
      "spacing": "Small",
      "size": "Small",
      "$when": "${role == 'Manager'}"
    },
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "Try saying (English)",
      "weight": "Bolder",
      "spacing": "Medium",
      "size": "Small",
      "$when": "${role == 'Admin'}"
    },
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "• view audit log · show pending approvals\n• force release 13122 · show order 13122 · logout",
      "wrap": true,
      "spacing": "Small",
      "size": "Small",
      "$when": "${role == 'Admin'}"
    },
    {
      "type": "TextBlock",
      "text": "Tip: Prefer one language per message. Vietnamese like hướng dẫn / trợ giúp also opens this card.",
      "wrap": true,
      "isSubtle": true,
      "size": "Small",
      "spacing": "Large"
    }
  ]
}
